<article class="env-proposition" id="6ADF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/6ADF">Proposition <span data-tag="6ADF">4.1.2.13</span>.</a> The collection of smooth maps $p: X \rightarrow S$ is stable under filtered colimits in $(\sSet )_{/S}$. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Corollary <a href="/tag/D9BF" data-tag="D9BF">4.1.2.4</a> with characterization $(1)$ of Proposition <a href="/tag/8CFE" data-tag="8CFE">4.1.2.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>